ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models
Project Documentation
1. Introduction
ComicCraft is an AI-powered comic story creation application designed to help users create comics from simple story ideas. The system uses Gemini models to generate story content such as characters, scenes, dialogue, narration, and visual descriptions.
The application combines AI-generated content with a user-controlled comic editor, allowing users to review, modify, organize, preview, and export their comics.
________________________________________
2. Project Title
ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models
________________________________________
3. Abstract
Comic creation traditionally requires multiple skills, including story writing, character development, dialogue writing, scene planning, illustration, and page layout. These requirements can make comic creation difficult and time-consuming for beginners.
ComicCraft provides an AI-assisted solution that simplifies this process. Users enter a basic story idea and select parameters such as genre, tone, language, and preferred style. Gemini models process the input and generate a structured comic story containing characters, scenes, panels story and comic panels. The completed comic can then be previewed and exported as a PDF or image, dialogue, narration, and visual prompts.
The generated content is presented through an interactive editor where users can modify the story and comic panels. The completed comic can then be previewed and exported as a PDF or image-based comic.
The project demonstrates the practical use of generative AI in creative content production while keeping the user involved in reviewing and editing the generated material.
________________________________________
4. Problem Statement
Creating a complete comic manually requires considerable time and creative skills.
A creator generally needs to:
•	Develop a story.
•	Create characters.
•	Write dialogue.
•	Design scenes.
•	Plan comic panels.
•	Create or obtain illustrations.
•	Arrange panels and text.
•	Produce the final document.
Beginners may find these tasks difficult.
ComicCraft addresses this problem by using Gemini-based AI assistance to automate much of the initial creative work while allowing users to control and edit the final result.
